                    </div>
                    
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</path></svg>

                    
                  </summary>
                </details>
                <div class="accordion__content-wrapper">
                  <div class="accordion__content rte" id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_XxkQEL-{{ section.id }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_XxkQEL-{{ section.id }}">
                    <p><strong>Take 1 softgel daily</strong> with a meal and a full glass of water for best results.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="accordion animate-item animate-item--child accordion--medium accordion--top-border" style="--index:2;">
                <details class="accordion__details">
                  <summary class="accordion__summary">
                    <div class="summary__title">
                      
                        <span class="material-icon material-symbols-outlined">
  local_shipping
</span>
                      
                      <h2 class="h4 accordion__title">
                        Shipping Information
                      </h2>
                    </div>
                    
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</path></svg>

                    
                  </summary>
                </details>
                <div class="accordion__content-wrapper">
                  <div class="accordion__content rte" id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_Qx6n7V-{{ section.id }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_Qx6n7V-{{ section.id }}">
                    <p>We ship to all regions nationwide. Our average delivery time is 3 to 5 days. <br><br>All orders are shipped with a tracking number.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div><div class="accordion animate-item animate-item--child accordion--medium accordion--top-border" style="--index:3;">
                <details class="accordion__details">
                  <summary class="accordion__summary">
                    <div class="summary__title">
                      
                        <span class="material-icon material-symbols-outlined">
  verified
</span>
                      
                      <h2 class="h4 accordion__title">
                        Our Guarantee
                      </h2>
                    </div>
                    
                      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</path></svg>

                    
                  </summary>
                </details>
                <div class="accordion__content-wrapper">
                  <div class="accordion__content rte" id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_UT7WdC-{{ section.id }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_UT7WdC-{{ section.id }}">
                    <p>Your order is 100% covered by our 90-day money-back guarantee.</p><p>If you're not satisfied, just let us know. We’ll refund your order in full — no questions asked.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

